1. SCOPE OF GRANT

Subject to full compliance with this license, anyone may, free of
charge:

  1. Play: play, copy and distribute the game and its source code;
  2. Personal derivative works: view, modify the source code and
     create derivative works (mods, self-modified builds) for
     personal learning, research and hobby purposes only.

2. OPEN-SOURCE OBLIGATION (SHARE-ALIKE)

Any derivative work of this work (including modified builds, mods
or redistributions) that is distributed or made publicly available
to anyone other than the author must:

  1. Publish its complete source code under this license verbatim;
  2. Credit the original author and link to the original project
     in a prominent place;
  3. Adopt this license in its entirety, with no additional
     restrictions.

3. NO COMMERCIAL USE

  1. You may not use this work or any derivative work for any
     commercial purpose, including but not limited to: selling,
     paid downloads, advertising revenue, in-app purchases,
     sponsored placement, bundling into paid platforms, or
     shipping as part of any paid product or service.
  2. Together with Sections 2 and 4, this constitutes a complete
     prohibition on deriving profit from this work or its
     derivatives in any form.

4. COMMERCIAL LICENSING

Any commercial use requires a separate prior written license from
the copyright holder. Contact: via issues or direct message on the
GitHub repository ikaros-521/SHATTERVER.

5. MISCELLANEOUS

  1. This work is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind;
  2. Any violation of this license terminates the grant
     automatically;
  3. In case of ambiguity between the Chinese and English versions,
     the Chinese version prevails.
